      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on a paper for my religious studies class about how traditionalist theology views recent changes in marriage and family stuff. could you help me by summarizing the main moral arguments theologians use to criticize these modern shifts? i want to really get into the heart of their moral reasoning and why they find these changes so problematic.",
