      "content": "Traditionalist theologians argue that modern shifts in marriage and family undermine the sacred, divinely ordained institution of the nuclear family, which they view as the fundamental building block of society. They contend that redefining marriage to include same-sex unions or allowing divorce without cause erodes the moral order by treating human relationships as mere social contracts rather than holy covenants. This erosion, they claim, leads to a societal collapse where children are deprived of the stable, loving environment necessary for their moral and spiritual development. Ultimately, they believe these changes represent a dangerous departure from eternal truths that threatens the very fabric of civilization.",
