      "content": "that's a good start. when they talk about how these changes are \"dangerous\" or \"undermine the sacred,\" do they use specific language to describe the morality of the modern secular side? like, is there a certain way they characterize the secular approach to marriage to show why they think it's fundamentally flawed or even harmful?",
